#: ../doc/animation.rst:44
msgid ""
"Colorful icons line the bottom of the clip for every keyframe "
"(`circle=Bézier`, `diamond=linear`, `square=constant`). Each icon matches "
"the color of its clip, effect, or transition. The selected item's keyframe "
"icons are shown brighter. Filtering the property list also filters these "
"icons. Click any icon to jump the play-head and select its clip, effect, or "
"transition without opening the Properties dock. Double-click the icon, or "
"right-click and choose :guilabel:`Properties`, to open the dock. Drag an "
"icon left or right to move the keyframe and fine‑tune your animation timing."
" The play-head moves to the keyframe's new position when you finish "
"dragging."
msgstr ""
"Ikon berwarna-warni berjajar di bagian bawah klip untuk setiap keyframe "
"(`circle=Bézier`, `diamond=linear`, `square=constant`). Setiap ikon sesuai "
"dengan warna klip, efek, atau transisinya. Ikon keyframe dari item yang "
"dipilih ditampilkan lebih cerah. Memfilter daftar properti juga memfilter "
"ikon-ikon ini. Klik ikon apa saja untuk melompat ke play-head dan memilih "
"klip, efek, atau transisinya tanpa membuka dock Properties. Klik dua kali "
"ikon, atau klik kanan dan pilih :guilabel:`Properties`, untuk membuka dock. "
"Seret ikon ke kiri atau kanan untuk memindahkan keyframe dan menyempurnakan "
"waktu animasi Anda. Play-head akan berpindah ke posisi baru keyframe saat "
"Anda selesai menyeret."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/animation.rst:48
msgid "Key Frames"
msgstr "Key Frame"

#: ../doc/animation.rst:49
msgid ""
"A keyframe remembers a property's value at a particular moment. For example,"
" to make a clip gradually grow larger, you can set its scale at the "
"beginning and choose a larger scale near the end. OpenShot calculates the "
"change between those two keyframes during playback."
msgstr ""
"Keyframe mengingat nilai properti pada saat tertentu. Misalnya, untuk "
"membuat klip tumbuh secara bertahap menjadi lebih besar, Anda dapat mengatur"
" skalanya di awal dan memilih skala yang lebih besar di dekat akhir. "
"OpenShot menghitung perubahan antara dua keyframe tersebut selama pemutaran."

#: ../doc/animation.rst:53
msgid ""
"With :ref:`auto_keyframes_ref` on (the default), move the playhead to the "
"moment you want to change and adjust a property in the Properties dock. "
"OpenShot adds a keyframe there, or updates it if one already exists. Move to"
" another moment and adjust the value again to build your animation."
msgstr ""
"Dengan :ref:`auto_keyframes_ref` aktif (default), pindahkan playhead ke saat"
" yang ingin Anda ubah dan sesuaikan properti di dock Properties. OpenShot "
"menambahkan keyframe di sana, atau memperbaruinya jika sudah ada. Pindah ke "
"saat lain dan sesuaikan nilainya lagi untuk membangun animasi Anda."

#: ../doc/animation.rst:57
msgid ""
"A property turns green when the playhead is on one of its keyframes. Small "
"markers along the bottom of the clip show where its keyframes are. Their "
"shapes indicate how the values change between them: ``circle=Bézier, "
"diamond=linear, square=constant``."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah properti berubah menjadi hijau saat playhead berada pada salah satu "
"keyframenya. Penanda kecil di sepanjang bagian bawah klip menunjukkan di "
"mana keyframe-keyframe tersebut berada. Bentuknya menunjukkan bagaimana "
"nilai berubah di antara mereka: ``circle=Bézier, diamond=linear, "
"square=constant``."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/animation.rst:61
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Next Marker` and :guilabel:`Previous Marker` toolbar "
"buttons to step through the selected item's keyframes. They follow whichever"
" clip, effect, or transition is selected. When an effect is selected, "
"navigation also stops at the start and end of its parent clip."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan tombol toolbar :guilabel:`Next Marker` dan :guilabel:`Previous "
"Marker` untuk melangkah melalui keyframe item yang dipilih. Mereka mengikuti"
" klip, efek, atau transisi yang dipilih. Saat efek dipilih, navigasi juga "
"berhenti di awal dan akhir klip induknya."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/animation.rst:65
msgid ""
"To adjust the **interpolation mode**, right click on the small graph icon "
"next to a property value."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengatur **mode interpolasi**, klik kanan pada ikon grafik kecil di "
"sebelah nilai properti."

